('APX-C-5533', '5533', 'Kite That Wouldn’t Fly', 'The Kite That Wouldn’t Fly On a sunny afternoon in a small Indian town, an excited 10-year-old boy proudly stands on a rooftop holding a handmade kite. Beside him, his younger sister eagerly offers advice, but he confidently waves her away. The boy launches the kite.', 15, null, 'https://x.com/rahulnanda86/status/2060954432938836406', '“The Kite That Wouldn’t Fly”

