('APX-S-5466-1', 'APX-C-5466', 1, null, null, null, '15-second live-action big-air skateboarding highlight continuing at the same huge outdoor ramp during deep golden sunset. Only one skateboarder and only one skateboard exist in the entire video. Do not duplicate the rider. Do not add extra skateboarders in the background. Start with a fast low side-rear tracking shot as the rider accelerates toward the largest ramp, not only from directly behind.', null, null, 'Do not duplicate the rider. Start with a fast low side-rear shot as the rider accelerates toward the largest ramp, not only from directly behind.', 'driver', null, null, null, null, null),
